'''Benjamin "Ben" Tennyson''' is an alternate version of [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|Ben Tennyson]] from [[Maximilian's Dimension]].

==Appearance==
Ben had a black shirt that has a green stripe in the middle with a white 10 and green stripes on the sides of his shirt. He wore brown cargo pants with pockets at the knees and green and white shoes. He wore the [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]] on his left wrist.

At age 10 he looked exactly like his [[Dimension 27998.3]] [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|counterpart]], as briefly seen in the photo that [[Maximilian Tennyson|Maximilian]] holds while he's traveling between dimensions.

<gallery hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent" captionalign="center" spacing="small">
Maximilian Young Family Photo.png|10-year old Ben
</gallery>

==Personality==
Despite being older, Ben was still over-confident like many of his alternate dimension counterparts, which was ultimately what led to his demise, as he believed he could take on [[Alien X (Reboot)|Alien X]] alone.

He seemed to have developed a high level of trust with his grandfather, calling him by his name instead of "Grandpa" (like most Ben Tennysons do).

==History==
===Background===
On his summer vacation, Ben found the [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]]. He also seemingly found the [[Omnitrix Key]] and upgraded his Omnitrix with it, as seen in the photo Maximilian holds. At some point he gained an Omnitrix that resembled the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|second Omnitrix]].

Ben and his [[Maximilian Tennyson|grandfather]] were present when [[Alien X (Reboot)|Alien X]] invaded [[Maximilian's Dimension|their dimension]]'s [[Bellwood (Reboot)|Bellwood]]. Max, seeing how powerful Alien X was, asked Ben to warp away with him, but Ben decided to take on Alien X himself. Later, in a construction site, Ben fought Alien X as [[Four Arms (Reboot)|Four Arms]], but is knocked away by the latter's telekinesis. During their struggle, Ben's Omnitrix times out, allowing Alien X to claim both his Omnitrix and his life.

===Ben 10===
In ''[[Alien X-Tinction]]'', Maximilian told [[Team Tennyson (Reboot)|Team Tennyson]] how his Ben died, being shown in a flashback.

==Powers and Abilities==
===Equipment===
[[File:Tinction (1005).png|thumb|Omnitrix]]
Ben possessed the Omnitrix, which allowed him to transform into aliens and use their powers and abilities.

